<title>JAPAN: Nissan Mutual-related shares fall in afternoon.</title>
<headline>Nissan Mutual-related shares fall in afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firms with Nissan Mutual Life Insurance Co as a major shareholder were lower in Friday afternoon trade, after the Ministry of Finance ordered the insurer to halt its operations.</p>
<p>As of 0414 GMT, Hitachi Zosen Corp, which has 22.07 million shares held by Nissan Mutual, was down 14 yen at 439. Nissan Fire &amp; Marine Insurance Co Ltd, which has 12.97 million shares held by the medium-size insurer, fell 61 yen to 449. Nichirei Corp was down 12 yen at 473.</p>
<p>Nissan Diesel Motor Co Ltd lost 14 yen to 468.</p>
<p>Nissan Shatai Co Ltd shed two yen to 572.</p>
</text>
